    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good summary of the criticisms. When I'm teaching this, I want to show my students that these 'judicial activism' arguments are often just used as a way to roll back progress on civil rights. Can you frame the response so it shows how the procedural due process argument is often used to undermine the substantive rights we've gained?",
